n></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6779em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.654em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6779em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.654em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6779em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6779em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.9459em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:3.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"3.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 3240\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M473,2793\nc339.3,-1799.3,509.3,-2700,510,-2702 l0 -0\nc3.3,-7.3,9.3,-11,18,-11 H400000v40H1017.7\ns-90.5,478,-276.2,1466c-185.7,988,-279.5,1483,-281.5,1485c-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2c0,-1.3,-5.3,-32,-16,-92c-50.7,-293.3,-119.7,-693.3,-207,-1200\nc0,-1.3,-5.3,8.7,-16,30c-10.7,21.3,-21.3,42.7,-32,64s-16,33,-16,33s-26,-26,-26,-26\ns76,-153,76,-153s77,-151,77,-151c0.7,0.7,35.7,202,105,604c67.3,400.7,102,602.7,104,\n606zM1001 80h400000v40H1017.7z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0541em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实际工程不需要自己实现这个公式——用现成色彩库即可。真正需要自己做的是<strong>锚点集合的设计</strong>：锚点太多会让筛选器爆炸，太少会让接近边界的商品频繁误判。经验上颜色锚点在 20–40 个之间比较平衡（黑、白、灰、红、粉、橙、黄、棕、绿、蓝、紫、金、银 + 若干常用细分），且应该按<strong>品类</strong>而不是全局定义锚点集合——服装的锚点与手机壳的锚点不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"尺码标准化\">尺码标准化</h2><p>尺码的麻烦不在于单位换算，而在于<strong>同一个标签代表不同实测尺寸</strong>。<code>M</code> 在优衣库与在某个快时尚品牌的实测量差可以到 6 厘米；<code>US 8</code> 的女鞋对应 <code>EU 39</code> 还是 <code>EU 38.5</code> 取决于品类与品牌。因此尺码标准化必须区分三层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>是否可比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标签层</td>\n<td><code>M</code>、<code>38</code>、<code>Free Size</code>、<code>均码</code></td>\n<td>不可比（跨品牌）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体系层</td>\n<td>该标签所属的尺码体系（US/EU/UK/JP/CN）</td>\n<td>体系内可比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实测层</td>\n<td>胸围/腰围/脚长等实测值</td>\n<td>可比（真正的真相）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>标准化的正确目标是<strong>把标签层解析到体系层 + 尽可能补齐实测层</strong>，而不是在标签之间建立一个全局的换算表。全局换算表（<code>M = 38 = 10</code>）在有品类约束和品牌约束时才有意义，否则会产生&quot;男装 M 被换算成女装 10 码&quot;这类严重错误。</p>\n<p>体系间的转换在<strong>有实测层数据时</strong>才可靠。以鞋码为例，脚长与欧码之间的近似关系可以由线性模型描述：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>mm</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>EU</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{mm}} \\approx a \\cdot S_{\\text{EU}} + b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">mm</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">EU</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 按性别与品类分别拟合。这个模型的价值在于它能检测异常：当供应商声称 <code>EU 39</code> 但实测脚长是 260 mm 时（正常 EU 39 约 245 mm），数据必然有误。这类<strong>区间校验</strong>比精确换算更有用。</p>\n<p><code>均码</code>（Free Size / One Size）是必须单列的特例。它不是一个尺码值，而是一个尺码体系的声明，表示&quot;没有尺码维度&quot;。把它当成普通枚举值塞进尺码轴会污染该轴的枚举集合，正确做法是在变体轴定义上就把它表达为&quot;无此轴&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单位与数值属性\">单位与数值属性</h2><p>数值类属性的标准化是四段式里收益最直接的一段，因为它是纯机械的：解析出数值、归一单位、保留精度语义。</p>\n<p>标准化的输出不应是一个裸数字，而是一个带单位的结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;field&quot;: &quot;output_power&quot;,&#10;  &quot;value&quot;: 65,&#10;  &quot;unit&quot;: &quot;W&quot;,&#10;  &quot;si_value&quot;: 65,&#10;  &quot;precision&quot;: &quot;nominal&quot;,&#10;  &quot;source_text&quot;: &quot;65W 超级快充&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"output_power\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">65</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"unit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"W\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"si_value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">65</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"precision\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"nominal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"source_text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"65W 超级快充\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条记录里有三个设计点值得展开。</p>\n<p><strong><code>unit</code> 与 <code>si_value</code> 并存。</strong> 存规范化单位下的值是为了比较（<code>lb</code> 与 <code>g</code> 都能转成 <code>g</code> 比较），但原始单位必须保留，因为展示时用户期望看到 <code>65 W</code> 而不是 <code>65000 mW</code>，也期望看到 <code>1.2 lb</code> 而不是 <code>544.3 g</code>——见 <a href=\"../multilingual-attributes/currency-unit-format\">币种、度量衡与展示格式</a>。如果只存 SI 值，展示时会丢失&quot;供应商原本说的是什么单位&quot;这个信息。</p>\n<p><strong><code>precision</code> 语义。</strong> <code>nominal</code>（标称值，如&quot;65W&quot;）、<code>max</code>（最大值）、<code>typical</code>（典型值）、<code>range</code>（范围）在电气参数里区别重大。<code>65W</code> 的充电器实际可能是 <code>65W max</code> 或 <code>60W typical</code>。把这个语义丢掉会让跨商品的参数对比产生误导，而它必须从原文的修饰词（&quot;最大&quot;、&quot;峰值&quot;、&quot;典型&quot;）解析出来。</p>\n<p><strong><code>source_text</code> 原文保留。</strong> 这是审计与回溯的基础。当标准化把某个值判错时，必须能凭原文复核；且当映射规则改进后，需要能对 <code>source_text</code> 重跑标准化而不依赖已丢失的原始数据。</p>\n<p>不同单位的换算因子本身是确定的知识，但<strong>歧义单位</strong>需要特别处理：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原单位</th>\n<th>歧义</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>oz</code></td>\n<td>重量盎司 (28.35 g) vs 容量液盎司 (29.57 mL)</td>\n<td>按字段类型消歧，无法消歧则进复核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>t</code></td>\n<td>公吨 vs 美吨 vs 英吨</td>\n<td>按市场与品类消歧，默认公吨</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>寸</code></td>\n<td>中国市寸 (33.3 mm) vs 英寸 (25.4 mm)</td>\n<td>按市场消歧，中文文本默认市寸需谨慎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>G</code></td>\n<td>克 vs 加仑</td>\n<td>大小写敏感，按字段类型消歧</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的价值在于它是<strong>成本最低的一类校验</strong>：一个把 <code>1 oz</code> 的重量当容量算进去的目录，会在跨境标签合规上直接违规（净含量标错）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"标准化的版本化与灰名单\">标准化的版本化与灰名单</h2><p>标准化规则会随时间演进而商品记录可能已经发布。这意味着<strong>标准化结果的正确性依赖于规则版本</strong>。两个设计选择：</p>\n<p>其一，把每个标准化结果记录 <code>matcher_version</code>。当规则升级（比如 <code>炭黑</code> 从 <code>dark-grey</code> 改判为 <code>black</code>）时，可以按版本筛选出受影响记录并在后台重跑，而不是靠&quot;猜哪些记录受影响&quot;。</p>\n<p>其二，维护<strong>灰名单</strong>：那些已知会被误判、但暂时无法自动处理的原始值，显式记录&quot;不要自动归一&quot;。灰名单存在的理由是标准化永远有边界情形，而在没有灰名单的系统里，工程师为了处理 1% 的边界情形会把规则改得越来越激进，最终把 99% 的正确判定的规则复杂度推高到无法维护。灰名单让边界情形保持为&quot;原样保留、不进筛选&quot;，代价可控。</p>\n<p>标准化与 <code>[跨店铺/市场同款归并](../1_product-model/3_variant-grouping.md)</code> 的关系在这里体现得最直接：归并的 L3 属性指纹层要求被比较的属性已经标准化，否则同款商品会因为 <code>65W</code> 与 <code>65 W</code> 被链路的某一步截断而无法识别。同样，标准化也是跨市场比价的前提——只有归一后的属性值才能跨市场比较。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>标准化的目标是确定性、可审计、可扩展地把原始值映射到规范值，四段式结构：识别 → 解析 → 归一 → 落库。</li>\n<li>未命中的值原样保留但不注册为筛选枚举，进待审队列；否则筛选维度会无限膨胀直至失效。</li>\n<li>颜色以名称为主入口、色值为兜底；锚点集合按品类定义，感知距离用 CIEDE2000 而非 RGB 欧氏距离。</li>\n<li>尺码分标签层/体系层/实测层，不做跨品牌全局换算；<code>均码</code> 是&quot;无此轴&quot;的声明而非枚举值。</li>\n<li>数值属性存 <code>{value, unit, si_value, precision, source_text}</code>，保留原始单位与标称语义，并对 <code>oz</code>/<code>t</code>/<code>寸</code> 等歧义单位按字段类型消歧。</li>\n<li>标准化结果记录 <code>matcher_version</code> 以支持规则升级后的定向重跑；灰名单用于隔离无法自动处理的边界情形。</li>\n<li>标准化是 <a href=\"../product-model/variant-grouping\">跨店铺/市场同款归并</a> 与跨市场比价的质量上限；它的输出由 <a href=\"../multilingual-attributes/currency-unit-format\">币种、度量衡与展示格式</a> 负责渲染。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"属性值标准化（颜色/尺码/单位）","id":"属性值标准化-颜色-尺码-单位"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"颜色标准化","id":"颜色标准化"},{"level":2,"text":"尺码标准化","id":"尺码标准化"},{"level":2,"text":"单位与数值属性","id":"单位与数值属性"},{"level":2,"text":"标准化的版本化与灰名单","id":"标准化的版本化与灰名单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"标题/详情/属性的多语言字段设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-catalog-system/multilingual-attributes/localized-fields"},"next":{"title":"币种、度量衡与展示格式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-catalog-system/multilingual-attributes/currency-unit-format"}}